622	     * Assigns the owner's {@code householdId} on create: a stable, deterministic identifier for
623	     * the household, the first 12 hex characters of the SHA-256 digest of the owner's normalized
624	     * {@code lastName} and {@code postcode} (see {@link #householdIdFor}). Because it is derived
625	     * purely from those two fields, every owner sharing a last name and postcode is assigned the
626	     * same value automatically — including one joining an existing household via
627	     * {@code sharesHousehold} — independent of create order.
